journey on from sea to sea.

6
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:32,220
For that treasure known
by everybody as one piece?

7
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:37,440
Even though they laugh and
say it's just a fantasy!

8
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,857
We are going, there's no doubt we go.

9
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:45,180
Cause we can feel the
rush of energy overcome!

10
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:48,260
It will lead the way.

11
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:53,500
Keep pretending that you know what to do.

12
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,397
Books will only get in the way.

13
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:00,000
No guides for today.

14
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:02,437
Do not worry soon.

15
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,997
The rain will be gone with the wind.

16
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,717
Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.

17
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,630
Now that's what you'll do.

18
00:01:06,713 --> 00:01:07,757
Give it time and calm.

19
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,297
The storm that you have built within!

20
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:11,417
Come and have my board at number two.

21
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,537
Once tomorrow's wind picks up!

22
00:01:13,620 --> 00:01:14,777
We set stuff cause we can't.

23
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:15,897
Thresh it up, stand tall.

24
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,277
And take a look at one of you.

25
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,657
All the journey makes
me want to see somebody.

26
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:22,681
There are things out there
you just won't believe.

27
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:25,740
Beyond your wildest dreams!

28
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:30,780
Don't think for a second
it's not the truth.

29
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:34,800
That's the story most will believe?

30
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:37,420
Not me, come and see!

31
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:41,777
I am on a journey out to sea.

32
00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:43,297
The world done on my own.

33
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:45,337
I've got my group of friends.

34
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:47,357
Together we've got our way!

35
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,957
That's how it's done.

36
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,017
Says your captain.

37
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,277
Who says it can't be done?

38
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,937
We haven't even tried.

39
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:55,937
Gotta just believe we'll
make it to the end!

40
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:58,577
I just wanna do it all right now.

41
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:00,817
Together surely we can.

42
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:02,717
Yes, we can!

43
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,117
You can!

44
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,757
Just take this moment in.

45
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,057
We can.

46
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:09,437
I can.

47
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:12,097
Just take this feeling in.

48
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:13,477
Right now.

49
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,900
Right now.

50
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:18,740
Oh yes, we can?

51
