200
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:36,810
Crush!

201
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:43,610
Crush!

202
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:48,080
What's Crush mean, anyway? That's funny.

203
00:11:48,260 --> 00:11:50,672
I thought that your race hated us humans.

204
00:11:52,780 --> 00:11:53,680
Race, huh?

205
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:58,357
That's a label that the ignorant
give to other minx out of fear.

206
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,270
Nothing more.

207
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:00,952
And what does that mean?

208
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,420
To us, what you, Tia,

209
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:06,285
