minx who happen to have less hair.

210
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:10,060
A different look, but
the same race. I see.

211
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:13,560
So no reason to hate humans
unless we give you one?

212
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:14,910
Exactly.

213
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:18,697
We don't judge by one's differences,
but rather by their character.

214
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,309
I hope you deal well, too.

215
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,480
You too!

216
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:26,657
We full-body minks are certainly
proud of our fur, no doubt about it.

217
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:31,500
But a lesser mink coat
definitely has its charm as well,

218
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:33,357
especially because they're rare here.

219
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,322
